    "html": "② <math display=\"inline\"><mrow><msub><mi>f</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>⋅</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>−</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></math> ✓; <math display=\"inline\"><mrow><mspace width=\"1.0em\"></mspace><msub><mi>f</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>⋅</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>−</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></math> ✓; <math display=\"inline\"><mrow><mspace width=\"1.0em\"></mspace><msub><mi>f</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>⋅</mo><mn>8</mn><mo>−</mo><mn>9</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></math> ✓"
